DTSTART:20261201T063000
DTEND:20261201T063500
SUMMARY:Day 6 Morning: The cost
DESCRIPTION:Week 1: See It. You can't fix what you won't count.\n\nWrite a
  specific list of what lying has cost you: trust\, peace\, money\, time\, 
 closeness\, sleep\, respect for yourself. Names and moments\, not general 
 ideas.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Set aside 15 minutes. Write six headings: Trust
 \, Peace\, Money\, Time\, Closeness\, Self-respect.\n2. Under each\, write
  at least one specific moment lying cost you. Use names and dates.\n3. Rea
 d the list out loud to yourself once.\n4. Circle the one that hurts most.\
 n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say 
 ___."\n\nWhy it works: Lying less goes with better health and relationship
 s. The payoff of this work isn't only your marriage. You should also start
  to feel better. (Kelly & Wang (2012)\, American Psychological Association
  convention)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 6 Morning: The cost
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
