BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:truth-ledger-34@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261207T063000
DTEND:20261207T063500
SUMMARY:Day 12 Morning: What lying pays you
DESCRIPTION:Week 2: The Fear Underneath. Every lie is protecting something
 .\n\nBe honest: lying pays. It buys relief\, approval\, time and escape. E
 ach time today\, name the payoff you were after.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Each 
 time you lie or feel the urge\, finish this sentence in your head: "Lying 
 right now would get me ___."\n2. Common answers: out of trouble\, respect\
 , time\, peace\, attention. Write the answer in your ledger.\n3. Tonight\,
  circle the payoff that showed up most. Write what you'll do with that fee
 ling instead of lying.\n(Full instructions: "The nightly ledger" in How to
  practice\, in your guide.)\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If 
 ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Compulsive lying is rea
 l\, and there is no proven cure yet. This guide is built from CBT tools th
 at work for similar problems\, arranged so one man can do the work on his 
 own\, every day. (Curtis & Hart (2020)\, Psychiatric Research and Clinical
  Practice)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 12 Morning: What lying pays you
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
