UID:truth-ledger-44@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261210T063000
DTEND:20261210T063500
SUMMARY:Day 15 Morning: The three-second pause
DESCRIPTION:Week 3: The Pause. Lies are fast. Truth needs three seconds.\n
 \nPractice the sequence: alarm\, breath\, "Give me a second." Use it at le
 ast once today\, even in an easy conversation.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Practic
 e the pause twice this morning\, alone\, out loud: alarm\, breath\, "Give 
 me a second."\n2. Use it at least once today in a real conversation\, even
  an easy one.\n3. Each time you use it\, put a P in your ledger.\n(Full in
 structions: "The three-second pause" in How to practice\, in your guide.)\
 n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say 
 ___."\n\nWhy it works: The pause interrupts an automatic response. The thr
 ee-second pause isn't magic. It's the gap where your prepared true sentenc
 e gets a chance. (Kobis et al. (2019)\, Perspectives on Psychological Scie
 nce\; Curtis & Hart (2020))
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 15 Morning: The three-second pause
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
