SUMMARY:Day 15 Evening Ledger
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: How many times did you pause? What happene
 d in those three seconds?\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies told today (#): 
 what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n3. Corrections made (#)
 \n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, and the fear (failure / 
 rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: "If I tell 
 the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when I told the t
 ruth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If ___\, then I'
 ll say ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
