SUMMARY:Day 16 Evening Ledger
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: How high did the urge get? How long did it
  take to drop when you didn't feed it?\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies tol
 d today (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n3. Correct
 ions made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, and the fea
 r (failure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head
 : "If I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when
  I told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If 
 ___\, then I'll say ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
