DTEND:20261212T211000
SUMMARY:Day 17 Evening Ledger
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: How did it feel not to have an answer? Did
  anyone actually think less of you?\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies told t
 oday (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)\n3. Correction
 s made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, and the fear (
 failure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: "
 If I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when I 
 told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If ___
 \, then I'll say ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
