BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:truth-ledger-62@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261216T063000
DTEND:20261216T063500
SUMMARY:Day 21 Morning: Week 3 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 3: The Pause. Lies are fast. Truth needs three seconds.\n
 \nRead your top three lie situations from Day 3.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. This 
 morning\, read your three lie situations from Day 3 and your Fear Map from
  Day 14.\n2. Tonight\, add up the week and compare it with Weeks 1 and 2.\
 n3. Write which situation still beats you most. That's your first if-then 
 plan tomorrow.\n(Full instructions: "The nightly ledger" in How to practic
 e\, in your guide.)\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happ
 ens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior changes 
 your behavior. The nightly ledger is the written record\, and the weekly r
 eview compares your numbers week to week. You can also enter your three nu
 mbers on each day in this guide. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological Bul
 letin)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 21 Morning: Week 3 review
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
