UID:truth-ledger-65@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261216T210000
DTEND:20261216T211000
SUMMARY:Day 21 Evening Ledger
DESCRIPTION:Tonight's question: Total the week. Is your pause count going 
 up while your lie count goes down? Which situation still beats you?\n\nTHE
  LEDGER (10 min)\n1. Lies told today (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught b
 efore I spoke (#)\n3. Corrections made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, 
 how tired I was\, and the fear (failure / rejection / conflict / looking w
 eak)\n5. The story in my head: "If I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6
 . What actually happened when I told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\
 , written as an if-then: "If ___\, then I'll say ___."\n8. One line of pra
 yer or thanks
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 21 Evening Ledger
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:truth-ledger-66@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261217T063000
DTEND:20261217T063500
SUMMARY:Day 22 Morning: Write your if-then plans
DESCRIPTION:Week 4: Replace the Lie. You can't just stop. You have to say 
 something else.\n\nWrite five if-then plans for your top lie situations: "
 If she asks whether I finished it\, then I say exactly how far I got." "If
  someone asks what I paid\, then I say the real number." Save them in your
  phone.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Take your top five lie situations from your le
 dger.\n2. For each one\, write an if-then plan: "If ___ (exact trigger)\, 
 then I say ___ (exact true words)."\n3. Keep each THEN short enough to say
  in one breath.\n4. Save all five in the pinned note on your phone.\n(Full
  instructions: "If-then plans" in How to practice\, in your guide.)\n\nBef
 ore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\
 n\nWhy it works: If-then plans work. Every morning you write one if-then p
 lan for the day's risk moment: "If she asks about the money\, then I'll sa
 y the real number." (Gollwitzer & Sheeran (2006)\, Advances in Experimenta
 l Social Psychology)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 22 Morning: Write your if-then plans
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
