BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:truth-ledger-69@bethemansystem.com
DTSTAMP:20261125T142333Z
DTSTART:20261218T063000
DTEND:20261218T063500
SUMMARY:Day 23 Morning: Rehearse out loud
DESCRIPTION:Week 4: Replace the Lie. You can't just stop. You have to say 
 something else.\n\nSay each if-then plan out loud three times\, in the car
  or the mirror. Your mouth has practiced the lie for years. Give it practi
 ce with the truth.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Find a private place: the car\, the
  shower\, a walk.\n2. Read each if-then plan out loud three times\, in a n
 ormal speaking voice.\n3. Say the THEN part as if the person is in front o
 f you.\n4. If any line makes you stumble\, shorten it until it doesn't.\n(
 Full instructions: "If-then plans" in How to practice\, in your guide.)\n\
 nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say __
 _."\n\nWhy it works: Break an automatic habit: notice it\, then replace it
 . Day 5 teaches you your body's alarm. The pause and a prepared true sente
 nce (Week 4) are the replacement response. (Bate\, Malouff\, Thorsteinsson
  & Bhullar (2011)\, Clinical Psychology Review (meta-analysis))
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 23 Morning: Rehearse out loud
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
