  made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\, and the fear (f
 ailure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: "I
 f I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when I t
 old the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If ___\
