DTSTART:20261231T063000
DTEND:20261231T063500
SUMMARY:Day 36 Morning: Money
DESCRIPTION:Week 6: Hard Truths. Tell the truth where it costs the most.\n
 \nMoney attracts lies. Today\, tell the exact truth about every money ques
 tion: what it cost\, where it went\, what you owe.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. Tod
 ay\, any question about money gets an exact answer: what it cost\, where i
 t went\, what you owe.\n2. If you don't know the exact number\, say so and
  look it up.\n3. Tonight\, write down every money truth you're still hidin
 g. That list goes on your ladder.\n(Full instructions: "The truth ladder" 
 in How to practice\, in your guide.)\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-t
 hen: "If ___ happens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Secrets weigh 
 on you even when nobody is asking. The lies you're still standing behind c
 ost you every day\, not just when you're questioned. That's why Week 6 has
  you start taking old lies down\, one at a time. (Slepian\, Chun & Mason (
 2017)\, Journal of Personality and Social Psychology)
BEGIN:VALARM
ACTION:DISPLAY
DESCRIPTION:Day 36 Morning: Money
TRIGGER:PT0M
END:VALARM
END:VEVENT
