 down. That's on your list of truths you still owe.\n\nTHE LEDGER (10 min)\
 n1. Lies told today (#): what\, to whom\n2. Lies caught before I spoke (#)
 \n3. Corrections made (#)\n4. The trigger: who\, where\, how tired I was\,
  and the fear (failure / rejection / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The stor
 y in my head: "If I tell the truth\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually h
 appened when I told the truth\n7. Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an i
