 on / conflict / looking weak)\n5. The story in my head: "If I tell the tru
 th\, ___ will happen."\n6. What actually happened when I told the truth\n7
 . Tomorrow's risk moment\, written as an if-then: "If ___\, then I'll say 
 ___."\n8. One line of prayer or thanks
