SUMMARY:Day 42 Morning: Week 6 review
DESCRIPTION:Week 6: Hard Truths. Tell the truth where it costs the most.\n
 \nRead your list of truths you still owe.\n\nHOW TO DO IT\n1. This morning
 \, read your list of truths you still owe.\n2. Tonight\, add up the week a
 nd compare it with Week 1.\n3. Pick the next truth on your list and set a 
 date to tell it.\n(Full instructions: "The nightly ledger" in How to pract
 ice\, in your guide.)\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ ha
 ppens\, then I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Tracking your behavior change
 s your behavior. The nightly ledger is the written record\, and the weekly
  review compares your numbers week to week. You can also enter your three 
 numbers on each day in this guide. (Harkin et al. (2016)\, Psychological B
 ulletin)
