SUMMARY:Day 47 Morning: What the truth gave you
DESCRIPTION:Week 7: A Man Whose Word Holds. Not a streak. An identity.\n\n
 List five things that seven weeks of telling the truth have given you.\n\n
 HOW TO DO IT\n1. Set a 10-minute timer.\n2. Write five specific things tel
 ling the truth has given you\, with a moment for each.\n3. Read them out l
 oud once.\n\nBefore you go\, write today's if-then: "If ___ happens\, then
  I'll say ___."\n\nWhy it works: Self-compassion makes men more likely to 
 make amends. Beating yourself up feeds shame\, and shame feeds hiding. Aft
 er a slip\, you write yourself two honest\, kind sentences\, then you go f
 ix it. (Breines & Chen (2012)\, Personality and Social Psychology Bulletin
 )
